//! What the calling family's operations hold beyond their operands.

import compiler.check.types (Type)
import compiler.emit.keys (Callee)

/// `ConstantRead` what a pure definition of no parameters and no type variables answers, run once
/// and kept for good by the unit as a value of `kept`, the type the definition answers; `Ticked` the
/// step a body run in place of a call counts; `Observed` its one operand, read into a value the C
/// compiler knows nothing of, so what made the operand runs even where nothing else reads it.
pub type CallingOp = | ConstantRead({ callee: Callee, kept: Type }) | Ticked | Observed
